  "question": {
    "text": "In a cuboid of dimension $2 \\mathrm{~L} \\times 2 \\mathrm{~L} \\times \\mathrm{L}$, a charge $q$ is placed at the centre of the surface ' $S$ ' having area of $4 \\mathrm{~L}^2$. The flux through the opposite surface to ' $\\mathrm{S}$ ' is given by",
