  "solution": {
    "text": "After placing similar cubic at the bottom, we get cube of side $2 \\mathrm{~L}$ having change $\\mathrm{q}$ at its centre.<br /><br />From the Gauss's law electric flux through whole<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/SzzTvHFauXWrbQsPicAom_uB5-dLuGGyZuCfDeMd-ys.original.fullsize.png\"><br><br />Flux passing through shaded face<br />$\\phi=\\frac{\\mathrm{q} / \\varepsilon_0}{6}=\\frac{\\mathrm{q}}{6 \\varepsilon_0}$",
